  "pages": 4
 },
 "summary": "BNX025H01 is a four-terminal surface-mount EMI filter block for DC supply lines, rated 20 A and 25 Vdc. Inside, an inductor sits in each of the supply and ground paths, followed by a shunt capacitor, a further series inductor on the supply side and a second shunt capacitor at the output. Insertion loss is at least 35 dB from 50 kHz to 1 GHz in a 50 Ω system. It is qualified to AEC-Q200 and works from -55 °C to 125 °C, with the rated current derated above 85 °C. BNX025H01L is the 180 mm reel of 400 pieces.",
